        "1JN"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "mt1",
      "content": [
        "1 John"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "chapter",
      "marker": "c",
      "number": "1",
      "sid": "1JN 1"
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "The Word of Life"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "r",
      "content": [
        "(",
        {
          "type": "ref",
          "loc": "LUK 24:36-49",
          "content": [
            "Luke 24:36–49"
          ]
        },
        "; ",
        {
          "type": "ref",
          "loc": "JHN 20:19-23",
          "content": [
            "John 20:19–23"
          ]
        },
        ")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "1",
          "sid": "1JN 1:1"
        },
        "That which was from ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " beginning, which we have heard, which we have seen with our own eyes, which we have gazed upon and touched ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "with"
          ]
        },
        " our ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "own"
          ]
        },
        " hands — ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "this is "
          ]
        },
        " the Word of life. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "2",
          "sid": "1JN 1:2"
        },
        "And ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "this is"
          ]
        },
        " the life that was revealed; we have seen ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "it"
          ]
        },
        " and testified ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "to it"
          ]
        },
        ", and we proclaim to you the eternal life that was with the Father and was revealed to us."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "3",
          "sid": "1JN 1:3"
        },
        "We proclaim to you what we have seen and heard, so that you also may have fellowship with us. And ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "this"
          ]
        },
        " fellowship of ours ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "is"
          ]
        },
        " with the Father and with His Son, Jesus Christ. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "4",
          "sid": "1JN 1:4"
        },
        "We write these things so that our",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "1:4 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "BYZ and TR "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "your"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        " joy may be complete."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "Walking in the Light"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "r",
      "content": [
        "(",
        {
          "type": "ref",
          "loc": "JHN 8:12-29",
          "content": [
            "John 8:12–29"
          ]
        },
        ")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "5",
          "sid": "1JN 1:5"
        },
        "And this is the message we have heard from Him and announce to you: God is light, and in Him there is no darkness ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "at all"
          ]
        },
        ". ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "6",
          "sid": "1JN 1:6"
        },
        "If we say we have fellowship with Him yet walk in the darkness, we lie and ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "do"
          ]
        },
        " not practice the truth. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "7",
          "sid": "1JN 1:7"
        },
        "But",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "1:7 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "NA does not include "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "But"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        " if we walk in the light as He is in the light, we have fellowship with one another, and the blood of Jesus His Son cleanses us from all sin."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "8",
          "sid": "1JN 1:8"
        },
        "If we say we have no sin, we deceive ourselves, and the truth is not in us. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "9",
          "sid": "1JN 1:9"
        },
        "If we confess our sins, He is faithful and just to forgive us ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "our"
          ]
        },
        " sins and to cleanse us from all unrighteousness. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "10",
          "sid": "1JN 1:10"
        },
        "If we say we have not sinned, we make Him out to be a liar, and His word is not in us."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "chapter",
      "marker": "c",
      "number": "2",
      "sid": "1JN 2"
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "Jesus Our Advocate"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "1",
          "sid": "1JN 2:1"
        },
        "My little children, I am writing these things to you so that you will not sin. ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "But"
          ]
        },
        " if anyone does sin, we have an advocate before the Father — Jesus Christ, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " Righteous ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "One"
          ]
        },
        ". ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "2",
          "sid": "1JN 2:2"
        },
        "He Himself is ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " atoning sacrifice",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "2:2 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "Or "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "the propitiation"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        " for our sins, and not only for ours but also for the ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "sins"
          ]
        },
        " of ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " whole world."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "3",
          "sid": "1JN 2:3"
        },
        "By this we can be sure that we have come to know Him: if we keep His commandments. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "4",
          "sid": "1JN 2:4"
        },
        "If anyone says, “I know Him,” ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "but"
          ]
        },
        " does not keep His commandments, he is a liar, and the truth is not in him. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "5",
          "sid": "1JN 2:5"
        },
        "But if anyone keeps His word, the love of God has been truly perfected in him. By this we know that we are in Him: ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "6",
          "sid": "1JN 2:6"
        },
        "Whoever claims to abide in Him must walk as ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "Jesus"
          ]
        },
        " walked."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "A New Commandment"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "7",
          "sid": "1JN 2:7"
        },
        "Beloved, I am not writing to you a new commandment, but an old ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "one"
          ]
        },
        ", which you have had from ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " beginning. ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "This"
          ]
        },
        " commandment is the message you have heard. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "8",
          "sid": "1JN 2:8"
        },
        "Then again, I am also writing to you a new commandment, which is true in Him and also in you. For the darkness is fading and the true light is already shining."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "9",
          "sid": "1JN 2:9"
        },
        "If anyone claims to be in the light ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "but"
          ]
        },
        " hates his brother, he is still in the darkness. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "10",
          "sid": "1JN 2:10"
        },
        "Whoever loves his brother remains in the light, and there is no cause of stumbling in him. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "11",
          "sid": "1JN 2:11"
        },
        "But whoever hates his brother is in the darkness and walks in the darkness. He does not know where he is going, because the darkness has blinded his eyes."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "12",
          "sid": "1JN 2:12"
        },
        "I am writing to you, little children, because ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "your"
          ]
        },
        " sins have been forgiven through His name."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "13",
          "sid": "1JN 2:13"
        },
        "I am writing to you, fathers, because you know Him who ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "is"
          ]
        },
        " from ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " beginning."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        "I am writing to you, young men, because you have overcome the evil ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "one"
          ]
        },
        ".",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "2:13 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "Or "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "you have overcome evil"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "; also in verse 14"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        "I have written to you, children, because you know the Father."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "14",
          "sid": "1JN 2:14"
        },
        "I have written to you, fathers, because you know Him who ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "is"
          ]
        },
        " from ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " beginning."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        "I have written to you, young men, because you are strong, and the word of God abides in you, and you have overcome the evil ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "one"
          ]
        },
        "."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "Do Not Love the World"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "15",
          "sid": "1JN 2:15"
        },
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "Do"
          ]
        },
        " not love the world ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "or"
          ]
        },
        " anything in the world. If anyone loves the world, the love of the Father is not in him. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "16",
          "sid": "1JN 2:16"
        },
        "For all that ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "is"
          ]
        },
        " in the world — the desires of the flesh, the desires of the eyes, and the pride of life — is not from the Father but from the world. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "17",
          "sid": "1JN 2:17"
        },
        "The world is passing away, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "along with"
          ]
        },
        " its desires; but whoever does the will of God remains forever."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "Beware of Antichrists"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "18",
          "sid": "1JN 2:18"
        },
        "Children, it is ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " last hour; and just as you have heard that the antichrist is coming, so now many antichrists have appeared. This is how we know it is ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " last hour. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "19",
          "sid": "1JN 2:19"
        },
        "They went out from us, but they did not belong to us. For if they had belonged to us, they would have remained with us. But ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "their departure"
          ]
        },
        " made it clear that none of them belonged to us."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "20",
          "sid": "1JN 2:20"
        },
        "You, however, have ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "an"
          ]
        },
        " anointing from the Holy ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "One"
          ]
        },
        ", and all of you know the truth.",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "2:20 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "BYZ and TR "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "and you know all things"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "21",
          "sid": "1JN 2:21"
        },
        "I have not written to you because you lack knowledge of the truth, but because you have it, and because no lie comes from the truth. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "22",
          "sid": "1JN 2:22"
        },
        "Who is the liar, if ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "it is"
          ]
        },
        " not the ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "one who"
          ]
        },
        " denies that Jesus is the Christ? This is the antichrist, who denies the Father and the Son. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "23",
          "sid": "1JN 2:23"
        },
        "Whoever denies the Son does not have the Father, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "but"
          ]
        },
        " whoever confesses the Son has the Father as well."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "Remain in Christ"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "24",
          "sid": "1JN 2:24"
        },
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "As for"
          ]
        },
        " you, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "let"
          ]
        },
        " what you have heard from ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " beginning remain in you. If ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "it"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "does"
          ]
        },
        ", you will also remain in the Son and in the Father. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "25",
          "sid": "1JN 2:25"
        },
        "And this is the promise that He Himself made to us: eternal life."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "26",
          "sid": "1JN 2:26"
        },
        "I have written these things to you about those who are trying to deceive you. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "27",
          "sid": "1JN 2:27"
        },
        "And ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "as for"
          ]
        },
        " you, the anointing you received from Him remains in you, and you do not need anyone to teach you. But just as ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "His"
          ]
        },
        " true and genuine anointing teaches you about all things, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "so"
          ]
        },
        " remain in Him as you have been taught."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "28",
          "sid": "1JN 2:28"
        },
        "And now, little children, remain in ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "Christ"
          ]
        },
        ",",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "2:28 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "Literally "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "remain in Him"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        " so that when He appears, we may be confident and unashamed before Him at His coming."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "29",
          "sid": "1JN 2:29"
        },
        "If you know that He is righteous, you also know that everyone who practices righteousness has been born of Him."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "chapter",
      "marker": "c",
      "number": "3",
      "sid": "1JN 3"
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "Children of God"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "1",
          "sid": "1JN 3:1"
        },
        "Behold what manner of love the Father has given to us, that we should be called children of God. And ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "that is what"
          ]
        },
        " we are! The reason the world does not know us ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "is"
          ]
        },
        " that it did not know Him. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "2",
          "sid": "1JN 3:2"
        },
        "Beloved, we are now children of God, and what we will be ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "has"
          ]
        },
        " not yet been revealed. We know that when ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "Christ"
          ]
        },
        " appears,",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "3:2 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "Literally "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "when He appears "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "or "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "when it appears"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        " we will be like Him, for we will see Him as He is. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "3",
          "sid": "1JN 3:3"
        },
        "And everyone who has this hope in Him purifies himself, just as  ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "Christ "
          ]
        },
        " is pure.",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "3:3 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "Literally "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "just as He is pure"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "4",
          "sid": "1JN 3:4"
        },
        "Everyone who practices sin practices lawlessness as well. Indeed, sin is lawlessness.",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "3:4 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "Or "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "is violation of the Law"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "5",
          "sid": "1JN 3:5"
        },
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "But"
          ]
        },
        " you know that ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "Christ"
          ]
        },
        " appeared to take away sins, and in Him there is no sin. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "6",
          "sid": "1JN 3:6"
        },
        "No one who remains in Him keeps on sinning. No one who continues to sin has seen Him ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "or"
          ]
        },
        " known Him."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "7",
          "sid": "1JN 3:7"
        },
        "Little children,",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "3:7 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "NA "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "Young children in training"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "let"
          ]
        },
        " no one deceive you: The ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "one who"
          ]
        },
        " practices righteousness is righteous, just as ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "Christ"
          ]
        },
        " is righteous.",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "3:7 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "Literally "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "He is righteous"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "8",
          "sid": "1JN 3:8"
        },
        "The ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "one who"
          ]
        },
        " practices sin is of the devil, because the devil has been sinning from ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " very start. This is why the Son of God was revealed, to destroy the works of the devil."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "9",
          "sid": "1JN 3:9"
        },
        "Anyone born of God refuses to practice sin, because ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "God’s"
          ]
        },
        " seed abides in him; he cannot go on sinning, because he has been born of God. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "10",
          "sid": "1JN 3:10"
        },
        "By this the children of God are distinguished ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "from"
          ]
        },
        " the children of the devil: Anyone who does not practice righteousness is not of God, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "nor is"
          ]
        },
        " anyone who does not love his brother."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "Love One Another"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "r",
      "content": [
        "(",
        {
          "type": "ref",
          "loc": "JHN 13:31-35",
          "content": [
            "John 13:31–35"
          ]
        },
        "; ",
        {
          "type": "ref",
          "loc": "ROM 12:9-13",
          "content": [
            "Romans 12:9–13"
          ]
        },
        ")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "11",
          "sid": "1JN 3:11"
        },
        "This is the message you have heard from ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " beginning: We should love one another. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "12",
          "sid": "1JN 3:12"
        },
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "Do"
          ]
        },
        " not ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "be"
          ]
        },
        " like Cain, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "who"
          ]
        },
        " belonged to the evil ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "one"
          ]
        },
        " and murdered his brother. And why did ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "Cain"
          ]
        },
        " slay him? Because his ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "own"
          ]
        },
        " deeds were evil, while those of his brother ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "were"
          ]
        },
        " righteous. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "13",
          "sid": "1JN 3:13"
        },
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "So"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "do"
          ]
        },
        " not be surprised, brothers, if the world hates you."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "14",
          "sid": "1JN 3:14"
        },
        "We know that we have passed from death to life, because we love ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "our"
          ]
        },
        " brothers. The ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "one who"
          ]
        },
        " does not love remains in death. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "15",
          "sid": "1JN 3:15"
        },
        "Everyone who hates his brother is a murderer, and you know that eternal life ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "does"
          ]
        },
        " not reside in a murderer."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "16",
          "sid": "1JN 3:16"
        },
        "By this we know what love ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "is"
          ]
        },
        ": ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "Jesus"
          ]
        },
        " laid down His life for us, and we ought to lay down ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "our"
          ]
        },
        " lives for ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "our"
          ]
        },
        " brothers. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "17",
          "sid": "1JN 3:17"
        },
        "If anyone with earthly possessions sees his brother ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "in"
          ]
        },
        " need, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "but"
          ]
        },
        " withholds his compassion from him, how ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "can"
          ]
        },
        " the love of God abide in him?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "18",
          "sid": "1JN 3:18"
        },
        "Little children, let us love not in word ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "and"
          ]
        },
        " speech, but in action and truth. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "19",
          "sid": "1JN 3:19"
        },
        "And by this we will know that we belong to the truth, and will assure our hearts in His presence: ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "20",
          "sid": "1JN 3:20"
        },
        "Even if our hearts condemn ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "us"
          ]
        },
        ", God is greater than our hearts, and He knows all things."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "21",
          "sid": "1JN 3:21"
        },
        "Beloved, if our hearts do not condemn ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "us"
          ]
        },
        ", we have confidence before God, ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "22",
          "sid": "1JN 3:22"
        },
        "and we will receive from Him whatever we ask, because we keep His commandments and do what is pleasing in His sight. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "23",
          "sid": "1JN 3:23"
        },
        "And this is His commandment: that we should believe in the name of His Son, Jesus Christ, and we should love one another just as He commanded us. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "24",
          "sid": "1JN 3:24"
        },
        "Whoever keeps His commandments remains in ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "God"
          ]
        },
        ", and ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "God"
          ]
        },
        " in him. And by this we know that He remains in us: by the Spirit He has given us."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "chapter",
      "marker": "c",
      "number": "4",
      "sid": "1JN 4"
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "Testing the Spirits"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "1",
          "sid": "1JN 4:1"
        },
        "Beloved, do not believe every spirit, but test the spirits ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "to see"
          ]
        },
        " whether they are from God. For many false prophets have gone out into the world. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "2",
          "sid": "1JN 4:2"
        },
        "By this you will know the Spirit of God: Every spirit that confesses ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "that"
          ]
        },
        " Jesus Christ has come in ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " flesh is from God, ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "3",
          "sid": "1JN 4:3"
        },
        "and every spirit that does not confess Jesus",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "4:3 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "BYZ and TR "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "that Jesus Christ has come in the flesh"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        " is not from God. This is the ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "spirit"
          ]
        },
        " of the antichrist, which you have heard is coming and ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "which"
          ]
        },
        " is already in the world at this time."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "4",
          "sid": "1JN 4:4"
        },
        "You, little children, are from God and have overcome them, because greater is He who ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "is"
          ]
        },
        " in you than he who ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "is"
          ]
        },
        " in the world. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "5",
          "sid": "1JN 4:5"
        },
        "They are of the world. That is why they speak from the world’s perspective, and the world listens to them. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "6",
          "sid": "1JN 4:6"
        },
        "We are from God. Whoever knows God listens to us; whoever is not from God does not listen to us. That is how we know the Spirit",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "4:6 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "Or "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "spirit"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        " of truth and the spirit of deception."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "Love Comes from God"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "7",
          "sid": "1JN 4:7"
        },
        "Beloved, let us love one another, because love comes from God. Everyone who loves has been born of God and knows God. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "8",
          "sid": "1JN 4:8"
        },
        "Whoever does not love does not know God, because God is love."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "9",
          "sid": "1JN 4:9"
        },
        "This is how God’s love was revealed among us: God sent His one and only",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "4:9 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "Or "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "only begotten "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "or "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "unique"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        " Son into the world, so that we might live through Him. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "10",
          "sid": "1JN 4:10"
        },
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "And"
          ]
        },
        " love consists in this: not that we loved God, but that He loved us and sent His Son ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "as the"
          ]
        },
        " atoning sacrifice",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "4:10 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "Or "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "as a propitiation"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        " for our sins."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "11",
          "sid": "1JN 4:11"
        },
        "Beloved, if God so loved us, we also ought to love one another. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "12",
          "sid": "1JN 4:12"
        },
        "No one has ever seen God; ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "but"
          ]
        },
        " if we love one another, God remains in us, and His love is perfected in us. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "13",
          "sid": "1JN 4:13"
        },
        "By this we know that we remain in Him, and He in us: He has given us of His Spirit. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "14",
          "sid": "1JN 4:14"
        },
        "And we have seen and testify that the Father has sent ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "His"
          ]
        },
        " Son ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "to be"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " Savior of the world."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "15",
          "sid": "1JN 4:15"
        },
        "If anyone confesses that Jesus is the Son of God, God abides in him, and he in God. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "16",
          "sid": "1JN 4:16"
        },
        "And we have come to know and believe the love that God has for us. God is love; whoever abides in love abides in God, and God in him. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "17",
          "sid": "1JN 4:17"
        },
        "In this ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "way"
          ]
        },
        ", love has been perfected among us, so that we may have confidence on the day of judgment; for in this world we are just like Him."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "18",
          "sid": "1JN 4:18"
        },
        "There is no fear in love, but perfect love drives out fear, because fear involves punishment. The ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "one who"
          ]
        },
        " fears has not been perfected in love. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "19",
          "sid": "1JN 4:19"
        },
        "We love",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "4:19 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "BYZ and TR "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "We love Him"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        " because He first loved us."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "20",
          "sid": "1JN 4:20"
        },
        "If anyone says, “I love God,” ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "but"
          ]
        },
        " hates his brother, he is a liar. For anyone who does not love his brother, whom he has seen, cannot love God, whom he has not seen. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "21",
          "sid": "1JN 4:21"
        },
        "And we have this commandment from Him: Whoever loves God must love his brother as well."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "chapter",
      "marker": "c",
      "number": "5",
      "sid": "1JN 5"
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "Overcoming the World"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "1",
          "sid": "1JN 5:1"
        },
        "Everyone who believes that Jesus is the Christ has been born of God, and everyone who loves the ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "Father"
          ]
        },
        " also loves those born of Him.",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "5:1 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "Literally "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "and everyone loving the One having begotten also loves the one having been begotten from Him."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "2",
          "sid": "1JN 5:2"
        },
        "By this we know that we love the children of God: when we love God and keep His commandments. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "3",
          "sid": "1JN 5:3"
        },
        "For this is the love of God, that we keep His commandments. And His commandments are not burdensome, ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "4",
          "sid": "1JN 5:4"
        },
        "because everyone born of God overcomes the world. And this is the victory that has overcome the world: our faith."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "5",
          "sid": "1JN 5:5"
        },
        "Who then overcomes the world? Only he who believes that Jesus is the Son of God. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "6",
          "sid": "1JN 5:6"
        },
        "This is the ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "One who"
          ]
        },
        " came by water and blood, Jesus Christ — not by water alone, but by water and blood. And it is the Spirit who testifies ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "to this"
          ]
        },
        ", because the Spirit is the truth. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "7",
          "sid": "1JN 5:7"
        },
        "For there are three that testify:",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "5:7 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "TR and PT "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "three that testify in heaven: The Father, the Word, and the Holy Spirit; and these three are one. ",
                {
                  "type": "char",
                  "marker": "fv",
                  "content": [
                    "8"
                  ]
                },
                "And there are three that testify on earth:"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "8",
          "sid": "1JN 5:8"
        },
        "the Spirit, the water, and the blood — and ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "these"
          ]
        },
        " three are in agreement."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "God’s Testimony about His Son"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "9",
          "sid": "1JN 5:9"
        },
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "Even"
          ]
        },
        " if we accept human testimony, the testimony of God is greater. For this is the testimony that God has ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "given"
          ]
        },
        " about His Son. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "10",
          "sid": "1JN 5:10"
        },
        "Whoever believes in the Son of God has ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "this"
          ]
        },
        " testimony within him; whoever does not believe God has made Him ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "out to be"
          ]
        },
        " a liar, because he has not believed in the testimony that God has given about His Son."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "11",
          "sid": "1JN 5:11"
        },
        "And this is ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "that"
          ]
        },
        " testimony: God has given us eternal life, and this life is in His Son. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "12",
          "sid": "1JN 5:12"
        },
        "Whoever has the Son has life; whoever does not have the Son of God does not have life."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "Effective Prayer"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "13",
          "sid": "1JN 5:13"
        },
        "I have written these things to you who believe in the name of the Son of God, so that you may know that you have eternal life.",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "5:13 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "BYZ and TR include "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "and that you may believe in the name of the Son of God"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "."
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "14",
          "sid": "1JN 5:14"
        },
        "And this is the confidence that we have before Him: If we ask anything according to His will, He hears us. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "15",
          "sid": "1JN 5:15"
        },
        "And if we know that He hears us in whatever we ask, we know that we already possess what we have asked of Him."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "16",
          "sid": "1JN 5:16"
        },
        "If anyone sees his brother committing a sin not leading to death, he should ask ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "God"
          ]
        },
        ", who will give life to those who commit ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "this kind of"
          ]
        },
        " sin. There is a sin that leads to death; I am not saying he should ask regarding that ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "sin"
          ]
        },
        ". ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "17",
          "sid": "1JN 5:17"
        },
        "All unrighteousness is sin, yet there is sin that does not lead to death."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "The True God"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "18",
          "sid": "1JN 5:18"
        },
        "We know that anyone born of God does not keep on sinning; the ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "One who"
          ]
        },
        " was born of God protects him,",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "5:18 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "Or "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "the one who was born of God protects himself "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "or "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "God protects the one born of Him"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        " and the evil ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "one"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "5:18 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "Or "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "evil"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "; similarly in verse 19"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        " cannot touch him. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "19",
          "sid": "1JN 5:19"
        },
        "We know that we are of God, and ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "that"
          ]
        },
        " the whole world is under the power of the evil ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "one"
          ]
        },
        ". ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "20",
          "sid": "1JN 5:20"
        },
        "And we know that the Son of God has come and has given us understanding, so that we may know Him who ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "is"
          ]
        },
        " true; and we are in Him who ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "is"
          ]
        },
        " true — in His Son Jesus Christ. He is the true God and eternal life."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "21",
          "sid": "1JN 5:21"
        },
        "Little children, keep yourselves from idols.",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "5:21 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "BYZ and TR include "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "Amen."
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}